  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMO UNICEF Myanmar 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar faces recurring challenges from Acute Watery Diarrhea (AWD)/Cholera outbreaks and severe flooding, significantly impacting vulnerable communities. Effective coordination, enhanced data management, and capacity building are critical to address these issues efficiently.Dutch Disaster Risk Reduction and Surge Support (DRRS) aims to strengthen the water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) Cluster coordination, improve data systems, and support evidence-based decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
